# (`TOOL_VERSIONS`), and the no-shared-state regression guard. The byte patterns
# are compiler-codegen-specific, so a listed SDK whose snapshot no longer
# matches needs its own pattern, and the test fails until it has one. The arm64
# pattern runs against real snapshots only on arm64 CI hosts; elsewhere
# synthetic buffers cover its shape, and no macOS-built snapshot is ever
# executed off macOS.
